    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> is invoked to apply type conversion to resolved\nrequest header values that don't yet match the method parameter type.",
      "translation": "一个 `<a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a>` 被调用，以将类型转换应用于尚未匹配方法参数类型的解析请求头值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "An <code>@RequestHeader</code> is a named value resolved from a request header.\nIt has a required flag and a default value to fall back on when the request\nheader does not exist.",
      "translation": "`@RequestHeader` 是一个从请求头解析出的命名值。它包含一个必需标志和一个默认值，当请求头不存在时使用该默认值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked when a named value is present but becomes <code>null</code> after conversion.",
      "translation": "当存在命名值但在转换后变为<code>null</code>时触发。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
