      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the given parameter type and value name into an argument value.",
      "translation": "将给定的参数类型和值名解析为参数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - a bean factory to use for resolving  ${...}\nplaceholder and #{...} SpEL expressions in default values;\nor <code>null</code> if default values are not expected to have expressions",
